      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "As pointed out by @{5b12d42e9ad122540bc69858|full_name}, this is the result of the VRCProjectSettings prefab not having data. One way to not have data is if your project has compile errors before/after importing the sdk. All prefabs imported will have all data missing, but re-importing fixes them. Clearly a bug on Unity and not the SDK as this happens in 2018 too.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
